                "They exhibit a distinct multi-tiered canopy structure: emergent layer (>45 m), main canopy (30-40 m), understory (15-25 m), and ground shrub/fern layer.",
                "Semi-Evergreen Forests are transitional ecotones between wet evergreen and moist deciduous forests, receiving 200 to 250 cm rainfall."
